			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@bglw\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>bglw</span></a></span> yeah—when you say website frontend, I assume you mean in client JS specifically? Or more broadly?</p>",
